WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
Come in quickly

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,360
Help me take this thing off, its neck is about to break.

3
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,560
Where is the booklet I asked you to take?

4
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:19,030
Okay, you two go out and make up for it.

5
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:21,470
The banquet in the front yard doesn’t go away so quickly, Master Shizi

6
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:34,100
Husband, you are so beautiful that no one else can

7
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:35,420
What's wrong

8
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,140
It's getting late

9
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:40,860
Husband, please rest early.

10
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:42,300
Husband has trouble with legs and feet

11
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:43,980
Otherwise, I'll come

12
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:49,360
Don't bother madam

13
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:51,190
That husband

14
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,060
Don't let me down
